{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610210/extras/Title.png?t=1744115940\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>THE LAWLESS ERA OF THE ENDLESS UNIVERSE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>&quot;WANT TO FEEL TRULY RETRO?&quot;</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>KLOSTYN</strong> is a sci-fi <strong>retro FPS</strong> that faithfully recreates the late-'90s shooter experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game follows <strong>Ethan Nova</strong>, a member of the Genesis team, sent to investigate the mysterious planet <strong>Arcadia</strong>. As they enter its orbit, they realize\u2014too late\u2014that the planet has already fallen under space pirate control. Their ship is attacked and crashes, leaving Ethan as the sole survivor. This is where his battle begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Authentic late-'90s low-poly models &amp; pixelated textures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>16 weapons</strong> + <strong>3 hidden weapons</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>50+ main campaign maps</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>15+ enemy types</strong> (space pirates, robots, alien creatures)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>6 boss levels</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>4 difficulty modes</strong>: Easy, Normal, Hard, Impossible</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Body horror-inspired enemy designs</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pilotable vehicles</strong>: Mecha suit and bikes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Custom map support</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>10+ mission pack maps</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Brutal gore effects</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Classic cinematic-style</strong> intro, ending, and cutscenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Weapons with <strong>Alt-Fire</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3610210?t=1744115940","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610210/29f2d82578c3d424517a7ada43b11b7f78663db9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744115940","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610210/49250b595d0814105ac4a3d7f14dffc6bd81696d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744115940","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610210/49250b595d0814105ac4a3d7f14dffc6bd81696d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744115940","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610210/extras/Title.png?t=1744115940\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>THE LAWLESS ERA OF THE ENDLESS UNIVERSE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>&quot;WANT TO FEEL TRULY RETRO?&quot;</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>KLOSTYN</strong> is a sci-fi <strong>retro FPS</strong> that faithfully recreates the late-'90s shooter experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game follows <strong>Ethan Nova</strong>, a member of the Genesis team, sent to investigate the mysterious planet <strong>Arcadia</strong>. As they enter its orbit, they realize\u2014too late\u2014that the planet has already fallen under space pirate control. Their ship is attacked and crashes, leaving Ethan as the sole survivor. This is where his battle begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Authentic late-'90s low-poly models &amp; pixelated textures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>16 weapons</strong> + <strong>3 hidden weapons</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>50+ main campaign maps</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>15+ enemy types</strong> (space pirates, robots, alien creatures)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>6 boss levels</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>4 difficulty modes</strong>: Easy, Normal, Hard, Impossible</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Body horror-inspired enemy designs</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pilotable vehicles</strong>: Mecha suit and bikes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Custom map support</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>10+ mission pack maps</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Brutal gore effects</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Classic cinematic-style</strong> intro, ending, and cutscenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Weapons with <strong>Alt-Fire</strong></p></li></ul>","developers":["Secordrian"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610210/771ce0e20859bb214bde47b1226d66761f0b63ab/header.jpg?t=1744115940","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Linux<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual-core 2.0 GHz or higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Graphics card that supports Vulkan<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>S